{"segs": ["PA_ja_175:0.2", "PA_ja_175:0.3"], "en": "The Second Book of Pairs, Chapter on the Virtuous (Kalyāṇavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_175:0.4"], "en": "5. The Ādiccupaṭṭhāna Jātaka:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_175:1.1", "PA_ja_175:1.2"], "en": "\"Among all beings, it is said, there are those who are concentrated in virtue;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_175:1.3", "PA_ja_175:1.4"], "en": "\"Behold this lowly branch-dweller who stands waiting upon the sun!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_175:2.1"], "en": "You do not recognize his virtue.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_175:2.2"], "en": "\"You praise [the fire] without understanding it;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_175:2.3"], "en": "the sacred fire has been extinguished,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_175:2.4"], "en": "and two water-pots have been broken.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_ja_175:3.1"], "en": "The Ādiccupaṭṭhāna Jātaka, the fifth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:48:33Z"}
]
